  "feature_docs": {
    "fb_marginal": "After each mixer, read computational bit-marginals m_i=P(bit_i=1) from the state (soft 'shots'). Classical detach \u2192 exploratory 1-body field h_i=\u2212(2m_i\u22121) (exploratory); next cost diagonal E[x]=\u2211_i h_i z_i(x) with z=1\u22122x. No clauses enter the cost. Sequence is measurement-feedback adaptive \u2192 not a fixed unitary exp(\u2212i\u03b3 Hc) / projector product / densified E.",
    "fb_break": "After each mixer, take soft expected assignment (or mode) from bit marginals; score WalkSAT-style break/make per variable on that assignment using the instance clauses; classical detach \u2192 1-body field h_i \u221d (make_i \u2212 break_i). Cost diagonal E[x]=\u2211 h_i z_i \u2014 1-local, \u2260 densified unsat count Hc=\u2211_c C_c. Adaptive across layers from samples."
  },
